world  pendulum strikes ball

floor
  size      4 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

pendulum
  is a               pendulum
  pivot height       1.01 m
  length             95 cm
  bob size           5 cm radius
  bob mass           1 kg
  rod thickness      2 cm
  rod mass           100 g
  starts swung back  63°
  damping            0.01 N·m·s/rad

ball
  is a      sphere 5 cm radius, 200 g
  rolls
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  moves     freely
  rests     on floor, 10 cm ahead of pendulum

cup
  is an             open box
  length            30 cm
  width             30 cm
  walls             12 cm
  wall thickness    1 cm
  base thickness    1 cm
  near wall height  2.5 cm
  stands            on floor, 1 m beyond ball

expect
  pendulum.bob touches ball
  ball comes to rest in cup
